/* Regression fixture for the iOS HULLO forwarding loop lifecycle.
 *
 * Variant under test is selected at compile time:
 *   -DFLOE_VARIANT_ORIGINAL -> loop_original.inc.h  (pinned 27b21dc1 +
 *                              embedding overlay = the shipped Build 237
 *                              source)
 *   -DFLOE_VARIANT_PATCHED  -> loop_patched.inc.h   (+ the
 *                              ios-forwarding-lifecycle overlay)
 *
 * Both loop includes are generated by test_office_forwarding_lifecycle.py
 * via mechanical marker extraction from the staged overlay states; the diff
 * between them is exactly the reviewed patch.
 *
 * REAL code exercised here:
 *   - net/FakeSocket.cpp, pinned 27b21dc1 (compiled unmodified);
 *   - the extracted HULLO forwarding block of the respective variant
 *     (byte-faithful; the three calls forming the two race windows reach the
 *     real implementation through pass-through gates);
 *   - CODocument.send2JS's crash-relevant line `std::string(buffer, length)`.
 *
 * MOCKED (explicitly not real): WKWebView / the JS side (a counted string
 * sink stands in for CoolURLSchemeHandler + evaluateJavaScript), UIKit view
 * controller behavior, COOLWSD/kit internals (the "engine" here is a harness
 * thread speaking the real fake-socket protocol), and LibreOffice. This
 * fixture therefore proves behavior of the app-side forwarding logic only;
 * it is not a device PPT reproduction.
 */

